  <text x="80" y="540" class="section">2. 核心算法：Power Iteration 做矩阵分解</text>
  <rect x="80" y="570" width="250" height="110" rx="18" class="card"/>
  <text x="110" y="612" class="body" font-weight="700">输入</text>
